.TH GETPGRP 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
getpgrp \- returns the calling process's process group id
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B pid_t getpgrp(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns the calling process's process group ID.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the value described above; errno is not modified.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR getpgrp (2)
